[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3600.15, "timestamp": "01:00:00", "text": "我将拥有自己的空间和办公室。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3603.99, "timestamp": "01:00:03", "text": "你可以说空格，因为嗯嗯，因为呃我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3605.309, "timestamp": "01:00:05", "text": "租户"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3609.829, "timestamp": "01:00:09", "text": "所有租户都离开了，呃，疏散空置房"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3613.349, "timestamp": "01:00:13", "text": "或者说，空置的，对，就是“空置”这个词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3615.349, "timestamp": "01:00:15", "text": "所以，我就说：“是啊，如果你想的话……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3618.63, "timestamp": "01:00:18", "text": "我们可以设立一个类似区域的地方，用于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3621.589, "timestamp": "01:00:21", "text": "你住的地方和楼上的一些地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3625.67, "timestamp": "01:00:25", "text": "我们将对楼上进行全面翻新。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3628.71, "timestamp": "01:00:28", "text": "放置并分成两部分，这样你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3632.349, "timestamp": "01:00:32", "text": "可以有两个租户，这样会更容易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3634.91, "timestamp": "01:00:34", "text": "管理以及所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3637.549, "timestamp": "01:00:37", "text": "东西。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3641.39, "timestamp": "01:00:41", "text": "对，差不多就是这样。我有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3645.589, "timestamp": "01:00:45", "text": "很担心，但最终我不得不这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3649.67, "timestamp": "01:00:49", "text": "我又要搬出去住了，但我还是要走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3650.589, "timestamp": "01:00:50", "text": "后退"}]